he Darjeeling Limited is my favorite  Wes Anderson it came out when I was just  starting college trying to find my  identity and others and it hit me square  in the face and yeah I do think it's the  best for now but that's not definitive  it's just the opening salvo and a  conversation between me and everybody  who watches this channel a bunch of film  geeks so what do you think hey everybody  thanks for watching I've been waiting  forever to do a video on Wes Anderson  this was so much fun  and me my friends really do have these  conversations all the time about which  we think is the best and you know I love  all I love moonrise kingdom and I love  Life Aquatic it and and and they're all  so good but you know everybody's got  their favorite for one reason or another  this is mine what's yours I me know in  the comments and if you want to  subscribe to this channel you can click  right over here and if you want to  pledge a dollar with $3 helps the most  per video thank you so much for watching  I'll see you all next Wednesday
 

